WEBVTT

00:00:01.180 --> 00:00:04.790
Inazuma Eleven GO is about to start!

00:00:05.500 --> 00:00:07.010
Revolution?

00:00:07.010 --> 00:00:10.070
That's a pretty mind-blowing feat.

00:00:16.120 --> 00:00:16.740
Hibiki-san!

00:00:17.140 --> 00:00:19.790
That's <i>the</i>  Hibiki Seigou...

00:00:22.140 --> 00:00:28.710
We intend to make Ishido Shuuji drop out of the running and install Hibiki-san as the new Holy Emperor.

00:00:29.360 --> 00:00:35.060
You must win the final coming up and enter the Nationals tournament at any cost.

00:00:35.060 --> 00:00:37.610
Losing is no longer an option.

00:00:38.070 --> 00:00:41.130
We aren't thinking of losing anymore.

00:00:41.670 --> 00:00:43.660
In fact, this is quite reassuring.

00:00:43.660 --> 00:00:48.310
Now we know we weren't the only ones raising the signal for rebellion.

00:00:50.570 --> 00:00:52.610
This is getting big.

00:00:53.250 --> 00:00:58.140
Could we just be witnessing an important turning point in history?

00:00:58.140 --> 00:01:00.820
We sure are, full-on.

00:01:10.690 --> 00:01:14.390
It's turned into a pretty big mess.

00:01:14.730 --> 00:01:20.390
Fifth Sector already has it in for us since we went against their score orders.

00:01:21.510 --> 00:01:27.140
If we start up a revolution or something, then we're <i>really</i>  asking for trouble!

00:01:29.360 --> 00:01:30.970
All right, I've decided!

00:01:32.450 --> 00:01:34.340
Decided on what?

00:01:34.340 --> 00:01:36.180
On the revolution!

00:01:36.180 --> 00:01:39.140
I mean, being part of a resistance sounds so cool!

00:01:40.170 --> 00:01:43.200
Now that I'm set, let's go, Hayami!

00:01:43.200 --> 00:01:46.100
Ma'am, I'm gonna leave this here!

00:01:47.030 --> 00:01:48.310
Hamano-kun!

00:01:58.080 --> 00:01:59.800
It's in!

00:02:01.300 --> 00:02:03.210
There's the end of the match!

00:02:03.210 --> 00:02:08.680
By defeating Aoba Academy, the ones to proceed from Kanto's B Block to the finals are...

00:02:08.680 --> 00:02:11.020
...Kaiou Academy!

00:02:18.590 --> 00:02:20.180
So it's Kaiou, as we thought.

00:02:35.980 --> 00:02:39.760
Raimon, your heads are ours for the taking.

00:04:50.440 --> 00:04:51.270
Kurama!

00:04:53.930 --> 00:04:55.140
Over here, Kurama!

00:04:59.410 --> 00:05:00.610
Nice, Shinsuke!

00:05:00.890 --> 00:05:01.360
Captain!

00:05:02.700 --> 00:05:03.830
Okay, over here!

00:05:06.050 --> 00:05:11.960
These kids might be able to stir up a real revolution.

00:05:13.780 --> 00:05:14.670
Hayami!

00:05:17.230 --> 00:05:18.880
Hey now, Hayami.

00:05:18.880 --> 00:05:20.730
We're a resistance, you know.

00:05:20.730 --> 00:05:23.170
You won't be able to start a revolution like that.

00:05:30.330 --> 00:05:32.430
<i>We're going to the Nationals.</i>

00:05:32.970 --> 00:05:35.460
<i>The fight's already begun.</i>

00:05:35.460 --> 00:05:38.970
<i>Nothing can stop us and we don't plan on stopping.</i>

00:05:38.970 --> 00:05:39.980
<i>Aren't you scared?</i>

00:05:40.670 --> 00:05:43.480
<i>I'd be lying if I said I wasn't...</i>

00:05:44.100 --> 00:05:48.410
<i>But I don't want to lie about my feelings for soccer.</i>

00:05:52.780 --> 00:05:53.540
Let's go.

00:06:07.370 --> 00:06:08.840
That aura from earlier...

00:06:17.130 --> 00:06:20.770
I'll bring out the power sleeping inside him!

00:06:21.500 --> 00:06:22.980
Here it comes, Matsukaze!

00:06:22.980 --> 00:06:25.070
Try stealing the ball from me!

00:06:27.790 --> 00:06:29.220
Go, Tenma!

00:06:29.220 --> 00:06:30.990
Don't lose to Tsurugi!

00:06:32.930 --> 00:06:34.620
Faster...

00:06:34.620 --> 00:06:36.060
Stronger...!

00:06:45.890 --> 00:06:46.550
Did he do it?

00:06:50.850 --> 00:06:52.220
Didn't work...

00:06:52.220 --> 00:06:54.100
It was looking pretty good though...

00:06:54.990 --> 00:06:57.140
He hasn't focused his energy enough yet.

00:07:01.390 --> 00:07:02.270
Do it again!

00:07:09.930 --> 00:07:14.990
Looks like I'll need to hack through this security if I want to keep going.

00:07:36.930 --> 00:07:39.840
No way, is it someone from Fifth Sector?

00:07:52.140 --> 00:07:53.110
Kudou-san!

00:07:56.450 --> 00:07:59.120
Don't scare me like that!

00:07:59.960 --> 00:08:03.340
So what's this about information on Kaiou?{suruuuu}

00:08:03.340 --> 00:08:04.460
Here it is.

00:08:09.830 --> 00:08:10.710
This is...!

00:08:15.200 --> 00:08:16.520
I'll get it this time!

00:08:20.440 --> 00:08:21.220
Did he do it?

00:08:29.380 --> 00:08:30.940
Didn't work again...

00:08:31.820 --> 00:08:33.240
Why can't I get it?

00:08:33.920 --> 00:08:36.870
Maybe that wasn't an Avatar after all?

00:08:39.300 --> 00:08:40.750
Okay!

00:08:40.750 --> 00:08:42.560
That's all for today's practice!

00:08:43.150 --> 00:08:44.780
We're done.

00:08:45.170 --> 00:08:47.230
Make sure you're getting enough water.

00:08:47.230 --> 00:08:48.140
Thanks.

00:08:48.400 --> 00:08:49.720
You're almost there.

00:08:49.720 --> 00:08:52.560
Keep at it, Tenma! I know you can do it.

00:08:52.560 --> 00:08:54.130
Thanks, I'll do my best.

00:08:59.170 --> 00:09:00.110
Kudou-san?

00:09:00.820 --> 00:09:02.140
Yes? It's Endou.

00:09:02.930 --> 00:09:04.960
How are they doing?

00:09:04.960 --> 00:09:08.650
They'll all pumped for the upcoming opponent.

00:09:09.220 --> 00:09:11.060
About that opponent...

00:09:11.500 --> 00:09:14.860
We've got new information on Kaiou.

00:09:15.510 --> 00:09:17.000
New information?

00:09:17.510 --> 00:09:18.420
Yeah.

00:09:18.420 --> 00:09:21.620
Endou, every player on Kaiou is a Seed.

00:09:22.230 --> 00:09:23.850
Every player is a Seed?!

00:09:25.630 --> 00:09:26.320
Yes...

00:09:27.750 --> 00:09:29.750
Yes, okay.

00:09:30.540 --> 00:09:32.530
Coach Endou, what was that call for?

00:09:33.110 --> 00:09:34.940
Every player is a Seed...

00:09:34.940 --> 00:09:37.010
You mean Kaiou Academy?

00:09:37.400 --> 00:09:38.550
Yeah.

00:09:38.550 --> 00:09:41.840
That's what it says according to Fifth Sector's database.

00:09:42.960 --> 00:09:46.080
So they're all Avatar users...

00:09:46.080 --> 00:09:47.310
That's not true.

00:09:48.450 --> 00:09:52.150
Just because they're a Seed doesn't mean they all use an Avatar.

00:09:52.710 --> 00:09:53.700
Really?

00:09:54.510 --> 00:09:59.440
Seeds are the players that Fifth Sector sends into each school...

00:09:59.440 --> 00:10:02.530
...to see whether those schools are obeying Fifth Sector's orders.

00:10:02.530 --> 00:10:06.120
They're observers who keep a watch on the school's soccer club.

00:10:06.560 --> 00:10:11.080
There are Seeds who do what I tried to do by using force to make others obey...

00:10:11.930 --> 00:10:16.570
And there are those who take other secret measures to control the team.

00:10:19.070 --> 00:10:22.930
Maybe we should take him off the team.

00:10:23.550 --> 00:10:29.570
So if we're up against a whole team of Seeds, they don't all necessarily have an Avatar?

00:10:29.570 --> 00:10:31.150
But that's no excuse to let your guard down.

00:10:32.900 --> 00:10:38.010
Seeds have all undergone a special regimen under Fifth Sector.

00:10:38.010 --> 00:10:40.860
Their physical abilities are meant to be feared.

00:10:43.260 --> 00:10:44.660
Here it comes, Fukami!

00:10:45.210 --> 00:10:46.920
Bring it, Namikawa!

00:10:57.220 --> 00:10:58.950
Every one of them is a Seed...

00:11:00.560 --> 00:11:01.970
Doesn't that sound fun?

00:11:03.410 --> 00:11:06.440
If we're gonna do it, then that just helps build the tension.

00:11:07.060 --> 00:11:12.460
Since all those Seeds are coming up against us, that just goes to show how serious Fifth Sector is.

00:11:12.460 --> 00:11:16.420
And if we beat them, the revolution might just succeed all at once!

00:11:19.940 --> 00:11:21.450
It definitely makes a great motivator.

00:11:24.580 --> 00:11:25.910
A sudden revolution, huh...

00:11:26.360 --> 00:11:27.370
Shindou!

00:11:27.370 --> 00:11:27.950
Yeah!

00:11:28.310 --> 00:11:29.200
Let's do it!

00:11:29.200 --> 00:11:30.670
It's a revolution!

00:11:31.220 --> 00:11:32.760
That's our Hamano-senpai!

00:11:34.900 --> 00:11:35.840
Sure thing!

00:11:36.160 --> 00:11:37.960
With that in mind, let's practice!

00:11:37.960 --> 00:11:39.100
Yeah!

00:11:41.990 --> 00:11:43.160
Hayami!

00:11:44.070 --> 00:11:45.400
What're you doing?

00:11:45.400 --> 00:11:46.550
C'mon, let's go!

00:11:47.240 --> 00:11:49.780
But I've got some business to do today...

00:11:49.780 --> 00:11:50.810
Business?

00:11:51.970 --> 00:11:53.810
Then you come, Shinsuke.

00:11:53.810 --> 00:11:55.600
I'll be your partner.

00:11:55.600 --> 00:11:56.230
Okay!

00:11:56.640 --> 00:12:00.010
All right! We'll start with ten laps around the grounds dribbling!

00:12:00.010 --> 00:12:00.960
O-Okay!

00:12:03.620 --> 00:12:05.770
Hamano-senpai is really getting into it.

00:12:05.770 --> 00:12:09.780
Well, things would get ugly if he <i>wasn't</i>  up for it.

00:12:20.590 --> 00:12:22.040
Welcome!

00:12:22.040 --> 00:12:25.320
Hmm, Hama-chan isn't with you today?

00:12:25.320 --> 00:12:28.550
It's rare of you to come by yourself.

00:12:38.900 --> 00:12:40.820
Inazuma Eleven...

00:12:40.820 --> 00:12:41.400
GO!

00:12:44.490 --> 00:12:46.280
Inazuma Eleven...

00:12:46.280 --> 00:12:47.090
GO!

00:12:48.320 --> 00:12:49.390
All right!

00:12:49.390 --> 00:12:51.910
Then let's get pumped up for today too!

00:12:52.220 --> 00:12:53.640
Yeah!

00:13:06.750 --> 00:13:07.500
Hayami!

00:13:13.030 --> 00:13:14.300
Keep going!

00:13:14.300 --> 00:13:16.080
Go, Tenma!

00:13:16.510 --> 00:13:17.870
You can do it, Tenma.

00:13:20.870 --> 00:13:23.050
It all began here.

00:13:24.390 --> 00:13:28.250
If Fifth Sector hadn't come to us back then...

00:13:28.860 --> 00:13:32.790
I would still be a nameless player at a nameless school...

00:13:39.210 --> 00:13:41.090
We can't win...

00:13:58.210 --> 00:14:00.940
We'll win against Raimon no matter what.

00:14:00.940 --> 00:14:03.500
I swear on my pride as a Seed.

00:14:08.340 --> 00:14:09.320
One more!

00:14:42.610 --> 00:14:44.000
Hayami-senpai!

00:14:47.360 --> 00:14:50.030
Your home is in this direction?

00:14:51.070 --> 00:14:52.030
Yeah.

00:14:56.150 --> 00:14:57.830
It's finally happening tomorrow.

00:14:58.610 --> 00:15:00.380
Let's win this one.

00:15:00.380 --> 00:15:04.090
We'll win, go to the Nationals, and if we keep winning there...

00:15:04.090 --> 00:15:08.800
We'll all get to play soccer the way we want to, just like before!

00:15:13.530 --> 00:15:16.850
Do you seriously think you'll be able to do that?

00:15:18.230 --> 00:15:21.420
I admit I thought so too for a bit.

00:15:21.420 --> 00:15:27.570
I thought it'd be nice if we didn't have to listen to Fifth Sector and we could play soccer freely.

00:15:27.570 --> 00:15:28.460
But...

00:15:29.330 --> 00:15:33.000
All of a sudden, you guys started talking about bigger things...

00:15:33.000 --> 00:15:35.490
You'll all losing it!

00:15:35.830 --> 00:15:38.330
Just because you met some guys from a resistance,

00:15:38.330 --> 00:15:42.700
you all get excited about this revolution and resistance and whatever...

00:15:44.120 --> 00:15:47.270
There's no way that'd ever possibly happen!

00:15:47.270 --> 00:15:49.630
We're just jr. high school kids!

00:15:54.630 --> 00:15:57.600
Why did things end up like this...

00:15:57.600 --> 00:16:00.060
I don't get any of it anymore.

00:16:03.000 --> 00:16:06.440
Hayami-senpai, you can't be thinking about quitting, are you?

00:16:08.370 --> 00:16:09.730
Quit?

00:16:11.690 --> 00:16:14.740
If I had the courage to, I would've done so long ago.

00:16:21.900 --> 00:16:23.050
Senpai...

00:16:31.510 --> 00:16:33.630
Okay, everyone's here.

00:16:34.090 --> 00:16:36.480
I know you guys can win.

00:16:36.480 --> 00:16:37.950
Have confidence in yourselves and go!

00:16:37.950 --> 00:16:38.650
Okay!

00:16:38.850 --> 00:16:40.970
We won't lose to those Kaiou guys!

00:16:41.460 --> 00:16:43.560
We'll show them what we're made of!

00:16:43.850 --> 00:16:45.270
Revolution, revolution!

00:16:45.590 --> 00:16:47.970
Amagi, can I ask you to watch the defense line?

00:16:47.970 --> 00:16:48.770
Got it.

00:16:49.000 --> 00:16:50.290
Let's get fired up!

00:16:50.290 --> 00:16:50.810
Yeah!

00:16:55.060 --> 00:16:56.890
Aoyama! Ichino!

00:16:57.750 --> 00:16:59.160
They're ex-club members.

00:17:00.310 --> 00:17:01.830
Are you here for something?

00:17:01.830 --> 00:17:02.790
Y-Yes.

00:17:04.910 --> 00:17:07.790
We want to play soccer again.

00:17:11.370 --> 00:17:15.880
Maybe we don't deserve to be allowed back on the team...

00:17:16.510 --> 00:17:20.680
But watching you all play soccer, it made us want to play again no matter what!

00:17:33.230 --> 00:17:34.320
I was waiting.

00:17:36.150 --> 00:17:37.300
Shindou!

00:17:37.300 --> 00:17:38.780
Are you letting them back in?

00:17:38.780 --> 00:17:39.570
Yes.

00:17:39.570 --> 00:17:40.960
Yes?

00:17:40.960 --> 00:17:44.050
These are the guys who got scared and ran away from Fifth Sector.

00:17:44.590 --> 00:17:46.830
But they came back.

00:17:47.550 --> 00:17:53.230
They saw us play and built up the resolve to fight against Fifth Sector again.

00:17:53.230 --> 00:17:55.230
Isn't that enough?

00:17:55.730 --> 00:18:00.600
And isn't this the very reason for the revolution?

00:18:01.240 --> 00:18:02.560
What do you mean?

00:18:03.100 --> 00:18:09.610
Of course, it's important that we win Holy Road and take the Holy Emperor's seat from Ishido Shuuji.

00:18:10.130 --> 00:18:12.570
But this is what I think...

00:18:12.570 --> 00:18:18.920
The true revolution is when people see our soccer, remember what makes soccer great,

00:18:18.920 --> 00:18:22.620
and decide to stand up themselves to bring that back.

00:18:23.420 --> 00:18:25.580
We can't stir up this revolution by ourselves.

00:18:26.150 --> 00:18:30.580
The revolution needs the power of <i>everyone</i>  who loves soccer!

00:18:31.130 --> 00:18:32.270
Captain!

00:18:32.270 --> 00:18:33.280
Amazing!

00:18:33.920 --> 00:18:36.260
W-Well, that's true...

00:18:36.590 --> 00:18:38.250
Isn't it fine then?

00:18:38.250 --> 00:18:40.170
They're back and all.

00:18:40.170 --> 00:18:43.640
It's better to have more friends around.

00:18:44.470 --> 00:18:45.600
Fine.

00:18:46.460 --> 00:18:47.980
Thank you so much!

00:18:47.980 --> 00:18:50.100
We'll do everything we can to help!

00:18:50.710 --> 00:18:53.290
All right, then let's head out!

00:18:58.600 --> 00:19:01.870
Raimon fans, thank you for waiting!

00:19:01.870 --> 00:19:05.010
The Holy Road's district prelims will finally be wrapping up!

00:19:05.010 --> 00:19:08.530
Today, at the fully-seated Holy Road Stadium,

00:19:08.530 --> 00:19:13.170
Kanto's district prelim finals of Kaiou Academy versus Raimon Jr. High...

00:19:13.170 --> 00:19:16.120
...will be presented by yours truly, Kakuma Ayumu!

00:19:16.120 --> 00:19:21.660
Which team will be the one to win and proceed to Holy Road's Nationals tournament?

00:19:21.660 --> 00:19:24.050
The victor of A Block, Raimon Jr. High,

00:19:24.370 --> 00:19:27.060
or the victor of B Block, Kaiou Academy?!

00:19:30.860 --> 00:19:32.510
You guys all ready?

00:19:32.720 --> 00:19:33.310
Yeah!

00:19:33.960 --> 00:19:35.360
Ready, scoundrels?!

00:19:35.360 --> 00:19:36.150
Aye!

00:19:39.990 --> 00:19:43.050
Both teams are in position!

00:19:43.800 --> 00:19:46.160
The match will begin soon!

00:19:49.980 --> 00:19:51.460
Raimon, huh.

00:19:51.900 --> 00:19:53.420
We'll crush them to the bone.

00:19:56.470 --> 00:19:57.750
Hayami-senpai...

00:19:59.820 --> 00:20:01.920
No, I need to concentrate on the game!

00:20:03.380 --> 00:20:05.880
Kaiou starts the game at kickoff!

00:20:05.880 --> 00:20:07.430
Here it comes, Raimon ruffians!

00:20:07.630 --> 00:20:11.150
Kaiou Academy makes a fast attack and heads up on the dribble!

00:20:12.130 --> 00:20:13.770
What's with that speed?

00:20:14.450 --> 00:20:15.190
Tenma!

00:20:19.080 --> 00:20:21.610
They've passed Shindou and Matsukaze!

00:20:21.610 --> 00:20:21.820
Kaizu!

00:20:23.030 --> 00:20:23.570
Touga!

00:20:24.100 --> 00:20:24.950
Nagisawa!

00:20:25.320 --> 00:20:26.200
Wanda!

00:20:26.710 --> 00:20:29.200
Now Kaiou is on a passing spree!

00:20:29.720 --> 00:20:31.260
What's with those movements?

00:20:31.660 --> 00:20:33.710
They have such superb control of the ball.

00:20:34.100 --> 00:20:35.790
Coach Endou...

00:20:38.460 --> 00:20:39.250
You're not getting through!

00:20:39.610 --> 00:20:41.300
So here comes the double-crosser.

00:20:43.470 --> 00:20:45.640
It's a tough fight for the ball!

00:20:46.180 --> 00:20:48.370
A fight between two Seeds!

00:20:48.370 --> 00:20:49.600
Don't lose, Tsurugi!

00:20:52.080 --> 00:20:53.350
All right, he got through!

00:20:53.760 --> 00:20:55.100
Not so fast!

00:20:57.750 --> 00:20:58.560
Yoshimine!

00:20:58.560 --> 00:21:01.030
His path is completely open!

00:21:01.030 --> 00:21:03.240
Flying Fish!

00:21:11.570 --> 00:21:15.180
Burning Catch!

00:21:21.830 --> 00:21:23.130
Sangoku-senpai!

00:21:23.910 --> 00:21:25.760
It's in!

00:21:25.760 --> 00:21:29.180
Kaiou gets the first goal not long after the starting whistle!

00:21:29.760 --> 00:21:30.930
Damn it!

00:21:32.200 --> 00:21:34.930
This is the power of Seeds...

00:21:42.050 --> 00:21:44.400
I told you...

00:21:44.400 --> 00:21:46.650
A revolution's impossible.

00:23:23.830 --> 00:23:26.840
Coach Endou gives us surprising orders.

00:23:26.840 --> 00:23:29.800
Huh, you want <i>me</i>  to be the goalkeeper?

00:23:29.800 --> 00:23:34.140
Next on Inazuma Eleven GO, 
 Fly! Tenma's Avatar!!

00:23:34.180 --> 00:23:35.960
This is super-dimensional soccer!

00:23:45.220 --> 00:23:47.940
The Inazuma Eleven GO's proverb today is...

00:23:52.330 --> 00:23:57.110
Revolution needs the power of <i>everyone</i>  who loves soccer!

00:23:57.110 --> 00:23:57.890
That's all!
